   "listingImageUrl": "https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/08/GlobeTheatre_ExhibitionOpening_280326_182.jpg",
   "listingImageAlt": "",
   "description": "<p><b data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Step Inside Our Exhibition Before the Curtain Rises</b></p>\n\n<p>Make your visit to Shakespeare's Globe even more memorable. Before the magic begins on stage, explore our immersive walk-through exhibition and discover how the Globe's stories are brought to life.</p>\n\n<p>Uncover fascinating tales from our history, get closer to some of our most iconic productions through seasonally curated displays, and enjoy interactive experiences including costumes and props. The exhibition is a self-guided experience, so you can explore at your own pace before your matinee performance.</p>\n\n<p><b>Special Offer for Matinee Ticket Holders</b><br />\nEnjoy exhibition entry for just <b>\u00a35 per person</b> when you hold a ticket for a matinee performance.</p>\n\n<p>Please note: Exhibition entry is available at any time between 09:30 and 17:00. This is a self-guided experience and does not include a guided tour.</p>\n",
